        <mxCell id="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-96" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Industrial plant – 110/6 kV supply with MV motors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Utility 110 kV (S&quot;k max/min 3000/2000 MVA) feeds a 16 MVA YNd5 main transformer.&lt;br&gt;The 6 kV switchboard supplies a 2.5 MW compressor, two 1.2 MW pumps and a 0.8 MW fan,&lt;br&gt;a 1.5 Mvar power-factor correction bank and two 1.6 MVA Dyn5 unit substations (MCC A/B).&lt;br&gt;The LV tie between MCC A and MCC B is normally open.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Try:&lt;/b&gt; Load Flow (voltage drop to the workshop, transformer loading, power factor);&lt;br&gt;Short Circuit IEC 60909 – motor contribution to the 6 kV and 0.4 kV fault levels;&lt;br&gt;close the LV tie, switch the PFC bank off, or run Motor Starting on the compressor." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#81c784;" vertex="1" parent="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="20" width="720" height="173.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
